+ * levels holds 6 floats: bass, mid, treb, bass_att, mid_att, treb_att (1.0 = song average).
+ * vol and vol_att are derived from them. Pass NULL to use projectM's own analysis again.
+ * The values stay in effect until changed; set them before each projectm_opengl_render_frame().
+ *
+ * @param instance The projectM instance handle.
+ * @param levels Pointer to 6 floats, or NULL.
